  "title": "Catalogue | UHAS",
  "text": "Catalogue | UHAS Skip to main content +233 (0) 54 6585633 [email protected] Welcome to the UHAS Login Register Main navigation Home About Us Librarian's Message Our Mission Our Vision Strategic Plan Our Policy Our Staff Services Catalogue E-Resources Off-Campus Access Subscribed Resources Carligh Research4life Hstalks Hstalks: Latest Releases Free Online Resources Discovery Tools/Databases Trial (Temporal Access) Databases UHASSPACE Training Library Capacity Development Scholarly Communication Data Literacy Research Guides Blog Contact Us Eng Fr Spn Catalogue Home Catalogue The UHAS Library Catalogue is an online tool that allows our library users to search and locate books, journals, and other materials in the library’s collection. It provides real-time availability and access information for efficient resource discovery. With our catalogue, our library users can access the over fourteen thousand (14,000) collection of print materials now. Through our library catalogue, you can search for these valuable books by typing in a keyword, author, or title. chatbot block Body Quick Links The University Instructors Testimonials Become a Teacher Events Programs Programs Bachelor Master Postgraduate Study online Undergraduate Academics Undergraduate Education Graduate Education Online Education Contact Us University of Health and Allied Sciences PMB 31, Ho, Volta Region, Ghana. +233 (0) 245 125359 [email protected] Footer Bottom Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions © 2024. All Rights Reserved.",
